{"t":"Isle of the Mists","s":"isle-of-the-mists-5e716","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Monk_Creature_49c11d.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Isle of the Mists</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Monk (Creature)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Monk_Creature_49c11d.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">South-west of Venore, East of the Plains of Havoc, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32831,32295,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32831, 32295, 7)</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Druids</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Unknown<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Unknown<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Islemists\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Islemists_91903c.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">5.1<br/>December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Isle of the Mists</b> is a small island, located in the sea east of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a>. Also known as \"Druid Island\", since only <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> are able to go there. The monks' boss, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fernfang\">Fernfang</a>, spawns on this island. After that, you can enter the island by stepping on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a> situated south of the Plains of Havoc temple, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32831,32295,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32831, 32295, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding-top:1px;overflow:auto\">There is also a <a href=\"#/quest/isle-of-the-mists-quest\">quest</a>, and some red roses spawn on the second floor of the island.</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fernfang\"><img alt=\"Fernfang\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fernfang_5c4e64.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fernfang\">Fernfang</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">230 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">180 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Holy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Holy_Damage_Icon_dc372b.gif\" width=\"9\